---

## 📋 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint                      | Access  | Description              |
|--------|-------------------------------|---------|--------------------------|
| POST   | /api/auth/signup              | Public  | Register user            |
| POST   | /api/auth/login               | Public  | Login user/admin         |
| GET    | /api/vehicles                 | User    | Get my vehicles          |
| POST   | /api/vehicles                 | User    | Add vehicle              |
| PUT    | /api/vehicles/{id}            | User    | Update vehicle           |
| DELETE | /api/vehicles/{id}            | User    | Delete vehicle           |
| GET    | /api/maintenance              | User    | Get maintenance records  |
| POST   | /api/maintenance              | User    | Log maintenance          |
| GET    | /api/schedules                | User    | Get schedules            |
| POST   | /api/schedules                | User    | Book schedule            |
| GET    | /api/services                 | Public  | Get all services         |
| POST   | /api/services                 | Admin   | Add service              |
| GET    | /api/shop                     | Public  | Get all products         |
| POST   | /api/shop                     | Admin   | Add product              |
| GET    | /api/admin/vehicles           | Admin   | All vehicles             |
| GET    | /api/admin/schedules/today    | Admin   | Today's schedules        |
| POST   | /api/admin/send-reminder      | Admin   | Send email reminder      |

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

| Layer     | Technology              |
|-----------|-------------------------|
| Backend   | Spring Boot 3.2, Java 17|
| Database  | MongoDB Atlas           |
| Security  | Spring Security + JWT   |
| Email     | Spring Mail (Gmail SMTP)|
| Frontend  | HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript |
| Icons     | Font Awesome 6.5        |

---

## 🔑 Password Requirements
- Minimum 8 characters
- At least 1 uppercase letter
- At least 1 special character

## 🚗 Registration Number Format
- `CAA0000` — 3 letters + 4 digits
- `KA0000` — 2 letters + 4 digits